Name: jmap_history_duration
Type: DURATION
Default-Value: 0
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED

The value advertised as maxHistoryDuration in the
urn:ietf:params:jmap:object-history account capability.  JMAP object
history comes from expunged messages and deleted mailboxes, which
**cyr_expire(8)** removes, so set this to the shorter of its **-X** and
**-D** durations.  A value of 0 advertises null: no time-based limit.
